WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.915
Every class now has a group ride starting every fifteen minutes, and the app shows

00:00:06.915 --> 00:00:08.114
you the next one.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.851
Sessions start on the quarter hours with ten seats each, and the app asks for the

00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:16.827
next two every thirty seconds.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.784
Class Start offers the next session: when it starts, how many have joined, and who

00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:28.640
is riding.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.218
When it is full, Join offers the one fifteen minutes later. In its last minute, Join

00:00:41.218 --> 00:00:42.971
now says it is starting.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.392
In the library, each open class shows its next group, counting down.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.181
The plan and the riders stay together on every screen, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.862
What the tests prove: the schedule, the countdown, a full session and the chips,

00:01:16.862 --> 00:01:19.000
read again every thirty seconds.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.193
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:27.538 --> 00:01:32.050
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.721
every hill and interval.

00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:39.244
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:39.244 --> 00:01:44.692
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:44.692 --> 00:01:47.682
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:48.027 --> 00:01:50.520
A custom workout lives under Profile.
